msgid "Native Time Control"
msgstr "原生时间控制"

msgid "Control"
msgstr "管控"

msgid "Native device time control"
msgstr "原生设备时间控制"

msgid "FIREWALL4 NATIVE POLICY"
msgstr "FIREWALL4 原生策略"

msgid "Device rules"
msgstr "设备规则"

msgid "Each item is a normal firewall4 traffic rule. Saving reloads firewall4 atomically."
msgstr "每一项都是标准 firewall4 通信规则；保存时由 firewall4 原子重载。"

msgid "Add device rule"
msgstr "添加设备规则"

msgid "New device rule"
msgstr "新设备规则"

msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "启用"

msgid "Device information"
msgstr "设备信息"

msgid "Unknown device"
msgstr "未知设备"

msgid "No current IP"
msgstr "暂无当前 IP"

msgid "Select a device by MAC address. Its current IP is shown for reference and is not used for matching."
msgstr "按 MAC 地址选择设备；当前 IP 仅供参考，不参与规则匹配。"

msgid "Select a device from the list."
msgstr "请从列表中选择设备。"

msgid "Blocked period"
msgstr "禁止时段"

msgid "Source zone"
msgstr "源区域"

msgid "Destination zone"
msgstr "目标区域"

msgid "Week days"
msgstr "生效星期"

msgid "Every day"
msgstr "每天"

msgid "Weekdays"
msgstr "工作日"

msgid "Weekend"
msgstr "周末"

msgid "next day"
msgstr "次日"

msgid "Mon"
msgstr "周一"

msgid "Tue"
msgstr "周二"

msgid "Wed"
msgstr "周三"

msgid "Thu"
msgstr "周四"

msgid "Fri"
msgstr "周五"

msgid "Sat"
msgstr "周六"

msgid "Sun"
msgstr "周日"

msgid "Monday"
msgstr "星期一"

msgid "Tuesday"
msgstr "星期二"

msgid "Wednesday"
msgstr "星期三"

msgid "Thursday"
msgstr "星期四"

msgid "Friday"
msgstr "星期五"

msgid "Saturday"
msgstr "星期六"

msgid "Sunday"
msgstr "星期日"

msgid "Block from"
msgstr "开始禁止"

msgid "Block until"
msgstr "禁止至"

msgid "When start is later than stop, nftables treats the range as crossing midnight."
msgstr "开始时间晚于结束时间时，nftables 会原生按跨午夜范围处理。"

msgid "Start and stop time must be different."
msgstr "开始时间与结束时间不能相同。"

msgid "Action"
msgstr "动作"

msgid "Reject"
msgstr "拒绝"

msgid "Drop"
msgstr "丢弃"

msgid "No daemon, no minute polling and no private nftables table. Rules are stored in /etc/config/firewall and compiled by firewall4 into nftables meta hour and meta day expressions."
msgstr "无守护进程、无每分钟轮询、无私有 nftables 表。规则直接保存在 /etc/config/firewall，并由 firewall4 编译为 nftables meta hour 与 meta day 表达式。"

msgid "firewall4 native"
msgstr "firewall4 原生"

msgid "%d rules"
msgstr "%d 条规则"

msgid "%d enabled"
msgstr "%d 条已启用"

msgid "0 background processes"
msgstr "0 个后台进程"

msgid "1. Select a device"
msgstr "1. 选择设备"

msgid "Choose a device by MAC address. Its current IP is displayed for reference only."
msgstr "按 MAC 地址选择设备；当前 IP 仅作为关联信息展示。"

msgid "2. Set blocked time"
msgstr "2. 设置禁止时段"

msgid "A range such as 22:00–07:00 crosses midnight natively. Empty weekdays means every day."
msgstr "例如 22:00–07:00 会由 nftables 原生按跨午夜时段处理；未选择星期表示每天。"

msgid "3. Save and apply"
msgstr "3. 保存并应用"

msgid "LuCI writes normal traffic-rule options and asks firewall4 to reload atomically."
msgstr "LuCI 写入标准通信规则，并请求 firewall4 原子重载。"

msgid "Native behavior:"
msgstr "原生行为："

msgid "Rules match only the selected MAC address, so DHCP address changes do not affect the policy. Weekdays refer to the packet’s current local calendar day. Existing conntrack or flow-offloaded sessions may continue until they reconnect; this app deliberately runs no timer or connection-killing daemon."
msgstr "规则只匹配所选 MAC 地址，因此 DHCP 分配的 IP 发生变化也不会影响策略。星期按数据包发生时的本地自然日判断。已有 conntrack 或流量卸载会话可能持续到重新连接；本应用刻意不运行定时器或连接清理守护进程。"

msgid "All day"
msgstr "全天"

msgid "Only devices with a current IPv4 address in the selected source zone are shown. The IP is for reference and is not used for matching."
msgstr "仅显示当前 IPv4 地址属于所选源区域的设备。IP 只供参考，不参与规则匹配。"

msgid "Select a device from the selected source zone."
msgstr "请选择属于所选源区域的设备。"

msgid "When enabled, no start or stop time is written and the rule applies for the entire selected day."
msgstr "启用后不写入开始或结束时间，规则在所选日期全天生效。"

msgid "New rules default to all day. Turn off All day to set a custom range; empty weekdays means every day."
msgstr "新规则默认全天生效。关闭“全天”后可设置自定义时段；未选择星期表示每天。"
